<description>&lt;p&gt;The Venezuelan army bombed an ELN guerrilla camp in Apure, killing at least 19 rebels, and a U.S. drone strike hit an ELN drug depot nearby, causing at least 20 deaths. Oliver Blanco met a U.S. official in Washington while U.S. officials negotiate a possible long-term military presence in Venezuela. President Trump said a one-day operation could capture Maduro and warned of possible U.S. action against Cuba, also claiming Venezuelan oil revenues far exceed Iran war costs. A soldier was arrested for betting $400,000 on Maduro's removal and has entered a court proceeding. The UCDP counted 2 battle-related deaths in 2007, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/03/world/americas/us-venezuela-strike-eln-drug-trafficking.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxQV2JtLTUxR2RiTmlwNnljTDdjcDVjeHVkYVg0QktsS0tiUVhCOVBWMGNfejJTbG1MNUNOQ2lFZnhla3hGTDJ2eVFXRG14Yjk3am8wM3gyQ3E5b1ZGRzNoalJMQ0I1MXUxbDdUMkRJdmZucFNXWTFFTkZUN3Vpc0FVeWRiYzM0Sno1cS1JNTZrTG1BbmRiQk54Z3RuWllZOF96NjkyZkRoQzdvYWs?oc=5&quot;&gt;WSJ&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxNWk8xbVpKVVo3aDJVZjZSa2pBOXB3SnNmam5iYlltcC01aWh2Z01oNEZRNmxMcTlsbkhZV2hMc1h0NzFiLXQyNWlxNTZIZDYxQ01sYTF2TTB5X0lsMGRIVVR1Ym9SODVaOXZQc1VGeXBPYk1GaUU5NDUzMVNERWkwa0JTX1haSmMyQWFN?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxPbk1XdkdndDBSNVpaeFRkRGZGLUExTFRDbnVDV3pOR3FWcV82Z3ViQl9qOUppTkI0VDc2WWYzT011UkpYNTdkdWg3VGRYa25aVWFRNXR3YUJVWDZuMk9VNjlMbW1sSEo0OEFUZktpZVlqVEY3aEhfbnJtSmxjZkZjNUhpLUFxNmVwRFE1NzdwWDJVWF9uZUo2MVB1TkR2NXFTdTRzVzg4V2NGa0l4aHhBMnhrcmRqaEI2NVVlZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;CiberCuba&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixgFBVV95cUxQbFE4emhNVkl